ver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card transport\" data-dt=\"2026-08-04T14:05\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">14:05</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag transport\">🛬 Arrival</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Arrive Busan — Gimhae Airport (PUS)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Take the Busan-Gimhae Light Railway (BGL) or bus to Haeundae. Journey ~1 hour to Haeundae Beach area.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gimhae+International+Airport+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 PUS Airport</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/김해국제공항\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card activity\" data-dt=\"2026-08-04T16:00\" data-lat=\"35.1602318553241\" data-lng=\"129.1600771067464\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">16:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag booked\">BOOKED ✓</span><span class=\"tag activity\">🏨 Check-in</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Check In — L7 Haeundae by Lotte Hotels</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">55 Haeun-daero 570beon-gil, Haeundae-gu, Busan. 3 nights (Aug 4–6). Breakfast included — buffet at <strong>Floating</strong> restaurant, 2F. Rated 9.5/10 (2,540 reviews).</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=L7+Haeundae+by+Lotte+Hotels+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 L7 Haeundae</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/L7해운대바이롯데호텔\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Evening</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card evening\" data-dt=\"2026-08-04T17:00\" data-lat=\"35.1587\" data-lng=\"129.1604\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">17:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🏖️ Beach</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Haeundae Beach</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Korea's most famous beach — 1.5km of white sand. Busy in summer but the atmosphere is electric. Great for a sunset stroll or a dip. Marine City skyline makes for a dramatic backdrop.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Haeundae+Beach+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Haeundae Beach</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/해운대해수욕장\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card evening\" data-dt=\"2026-08-04T18:00\" data-lat=\"35.1590\" data-lng=\"129.1610\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">18:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🛒 Market</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Haeundae Market</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Traditional market steps from the beach. Great for Busan street food — ssiat hotteok (seed-stuffed hotteok), pajeon (seafood pancake), and fresh fish.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Haeundae+Market+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Haeundae Market</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/해운대전통시장\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-04T19:30\" data-lat=\"35.145072053610974\" data-lng=\"129.1107782932536\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">19:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍽️ Dinner</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Anmok</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Dinner at Anmok near Haeundae — a local favourite for fresh Busan-style dining.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Anmok+restaurant+Haeundae+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Anmok</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/안목+해운대+부산\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"note-box\"><strong>Sky Capsule tomorrow</strong> — book 1 month ahead if possible. Very popular. Check availability at Haeundae Blueline Park website.</div>\n```\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":true,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","css":["../styles.css"],"toc":false,"include-in-header":[{"text":"<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leafl